        1240,
        494
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There shall be seven Deputy Mayors. One of them shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Management, one shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Intergovernmental Relations, one shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Personnel and Labor Relations, one shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Policy, one shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Economic Development, one shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Finance, and one shall be designated Deputy Mayor for Criminal Justice.",
